codex
The design is settled: one stored supervisor task owns two gated pump children plus the observed HEV-return child; a lock-backed first-event control drives ordered cleanup, and the bridge actor only serializes lifecycle publication. Endpoint descriptors are wrapped immediately in exactly-once tokens, while the reverse pump reuses one fixed `4 + MTU` buffer and batches at most one work slice.
